## Local Model API Serving

### ollama

[ollama](https://github.com/ollama/ollama) is a CPU inference engine for LLMs. 
With ollama, developers can build their local model API serving without GPU 
requirements.

#### Install Libraries and Set up Serving

- First, install ollama in its [official 
repository](https://github.com/ollama/ollama) based on your system (e.g. macOS, 
windows or linux).

